{"id":"encantador","lemma":"encantador","pos":"adj","rank":1538,"glosses":["charming, captivating, enchanting, lovely","delightful, lovely","winsome"],"ipa":"/enkantaˈdoɾ/","forms":{"feminine":"encantadora","masculinePlural":"encantadores","femininePlural":"encantadoras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-encantador.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es un muchacho encantador.","en":"He's a lovely young man.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/702955"},{"text":"Era una mujer encantadora.","en":"She was a charming woman.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639652"},{"text":"Puedes ser realmente encantador cuando quieres.","en":"You can be pretty charming when you want to be.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609667"},{"text":"Haríais una pareja encantadora.","en":"You'd make a lovely couple.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582022"},{"text":"Luces muy encantador hoy.","en":"You look very charming today."}]}